  "label": "User projected onto the visual material of the shocked woman",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman (the 'shocked_woman_on_phone') because her shocked expression is juxtaposed with the text 'and your dick is in her mom's mouth', which uses 'your' to directly address the viewer. The user is implicitly positioned as the person whose 'dick' is in the scenario, making the woman's reaction a visual representation of the user's imagined or expected response to the absurd situation.",
